The JAX port uses vectorized state transitions, explicit random keys, automatic
resets, and configurable game variants. Infrastructure and compatibility changes
were made on 2026-11-15. The functional API refactor also corrects Seaquest
returning its old state rather than its newly computed state. This is a separate implementation; the upstream authors
are not responsible for these modifications.
